          "title": "You'll want to know: سرعت",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "سرعت (sor'at) — \"speed\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "سرعت (sor'at) این قطار خیلی زیاد است. Sor'at-e in qatâr kheyli ziyâd ast. This train's speed is very high."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Bâ sor'at — quickly, at speed."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "sor'at was borrowed from Arabic surʿa 'speed, haste' (EtymDB)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
