              "text": "کنار زدن (kenâr zadan) — \"to pull over (to the side of the road)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "راننده کنار زد و ما پیاده شدیم. Rânande kenâr zad va mâ piyâde shodim. The driver pulled over and we got out."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "kenâr (side, edge) + zadan. Kenâr zadan can also mean to push something aside."
            }
          ]
        },
