          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "kenâr zadan is built from native kenâr 'side, edge', usually traced to Middle Persian kanārag, and the native verb zadan 'to strike'."
