            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "کمربند برای ایمنی مسافران مهم است. Kamarband barâ-ye imeni-ye mosâferân mohem ast. The belt matters for the safety of the passengers."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Kamarband-e imeni — a seat belt. Built on imen 'safe' + -i."
            }
          ]
        },
